               <div class="icon-box-items flex-column shadow p-3 h-100 bg-light">
                  <div class="icon border shadow">
                     <i class="fas fa-building"></i>
                  </div>
                  <div class="content">
                     <h3>Apartments/Flat</h3>
                     <p>
                        Luxury to ultra-premium apartments in Lucknow. Experience higher than average levels of comfort, quality and convenience with extra amenities.
                     </p>
